  631: // tab container, which is what keeps spheres-view.js unmodified. Do not add a
  632: // container parameter to the module.
  633: //
  634: // Gated on getRole(), NOT effectiveRole(): whether to fetch admin code is a
  635: // question of authority, and effectiveRole() reports 'player' for a real ST in
  636: // preview mode. Gating the fetch on it would strip an ST of their own admin code
  637: // the moment they toggle preview, and inverts the ADR-007 D3 contract.
  638: //
  639: // Module and stylesheet are fetched CONCURRENTLY and both awaited before render:
  640: // awaiting them in series would add a round trip, and rendering before the sheet
  641: // resolves would flash unstyled. Neither trade is necessary.
  642: async function initSpheresSurface(el) {
  643:   if (!el) return;
  644:   const role = getRole();
  645:   if (role !== 'st' && role !== 'dev') return;
